  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"ue1edb2c7\" id=\"ue1edb2c7\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc53fcb73\" id=\"uc53fcb73\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">参考文档：</span><a href=\"https://docs.micropython.org/en/latest/library/machine.RTC.html#machine-rtc\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u7b7ff8d1\" id=\"u7b7ff8d1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u08eee227\" id=\"u08eee227\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">https://docs.micropython.org/en/latest/library/machine.RTC.html#machine-rtc</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"u98d01004\" id=\"u98d01004\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf5b810a8\" id=\"uf5b810a8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"rDWLB\" id=\"rDWLB\"><span data-lake-id=\"u44906595\" id=\"u44906595\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">实时时钟（Real-Time Clock）</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uc15a5059\" id=\"uc15a5059\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5cfdba7b\" id=\"u5cfdba7b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">定义</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u152123b3\" id=\"u152123b3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u2d384f05\" id=\"u2d384f05\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">RTC 是计算机或电子设备中的一种硬件时钟，用于在设备断电后持续跟踪时间。它依靠独立的电源（如主板上的纽扣电池）运行，确保时间和日期信息不会丢失。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u447eb64f\" id=\"u447eb64f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u58cd5191\" id=\"u58cd5191\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">核心特点</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua7f829eb\" id=\"ua7f829eb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：</span></p><ul list=\"u568b48f4\"><li fid=\"ubfb32df9\" data-lake-id=\"u71977128\" id=\"u71977128\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2bcd366f\" id=\"u2bcd366f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">低功耗</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf20c0e91\" id=\"uf20c0e91\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：依靠小型电池可运行数年。</span></li><li fid=\"ubfb32df9\" data-lake-id=\"ue4a5f008\" id=\"ue4a5f008\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud45134f7\" id=\"ud45134f7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">精准性</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9fd3f594\" id=\"u9fd3f594\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：通常使用晶振保持时间精度。</span></li><li fid=\"ubfb32df9\" data-lake-id=\"u255d4ed3\" id=\"u255d4ed3\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u89164149\" id=\"u89164149\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">独立性</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u906e3898\" id=\"u906e3898\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：与主系统电源分离，断电后仍工作。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ufac94db5\" id=\"ufac94db5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3fbb3655\" id=\"u3fbb3655\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">应用场景</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u32a6c5da\" id=\"u32a6c5da\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">：</span></p><ul list=\"ub1f67323\"><li fid=\"ubb1cfe7c\" data-lake-id=\"u27e87a30\" id=\"u27e87a30\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba49487b\" id=\"uba49487b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">计算机、手机、嵌入式设备（如智能家居、工业控制器）的系统时间管理。</span></li><li fid=\"ubb1cfe7c\" data-lake-id=\"uf357fd8e\" id=\"uf357fd8e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub334476e\" id=\"ub334476e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\">记录日志、事件时间戳、定时唤醒设备等。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ue3c8a3ab\" id=\"ue3c8a3ab\"><span data-lake-id=\"uef749dd8\" id=\"uef749dd8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua0757ce5\" id=\"ua0757ce5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u46c29bde\" id=\"u46c29bde\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">RTC时间格式为：</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u06dc96de\" id=\"u06dc96de\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">(year, month, day, weekday, hours, minutes, seconds, subseconds)</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc5fdedd8\" id=\"uc5fdedd8\"><span data-lake-id=\"udfe1975e\" id=\"udfe1975e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">weekday: 0-6的范围，表示周一到周日</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubf97c183\" id=\"ubf97c183\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud72189e2\" id=\"ud72189e2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">subseconds: 时间戳的小数部分</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9868f8bf\" id=\"u9868f8bf\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua4b8ce80\" id=\"ua4b8ce80\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">​</span><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"HV32f\" id=\"HV32f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9c5101b9\" id=\"u9c5101b9\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">示例代码</span></h3><h4 data-lake-id=\"QjJqY\" id=\"QjJqY\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud62993d8\" id=\"ud62993d8\">导包</span></h4><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20machine%20import%20RTC%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22TtlHw%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h4 data-lake-id=\"K3TAP\" id=\"K3TAP\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u131367ec\" id=\"u131367ec\">初始化RTC</span></h4><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22rtc%20%3D%20RTC()%5Cnrtc.datetime((2025%2C%204%2C%2015%2C%201%2C%2018%2C%2005%2C%2036%2C%200))%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TuIMr%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h4 data-lake-id=\"Mfbn9\" id=\"Mfbn9\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6d926deb\" id=\"u6d926deb\">读取RTC的值</span></h4><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22while%20True%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(rtc.datetime())%5Cn%20%20%20%20time.sleep(1)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qXovj%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u824d3193\" id=\"u824d3193\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uab17c6a1\" id=\"uab17c6a1\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue5283413\" id=\"ue5283413\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"FcWxN\" id=\"FcWxN\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8a11d15f\" id=\"u8a11d15f\">练习：小时钟</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ucbdad392\" id=\"ucbdad392\"><span data-lake-id=\"u371eb0cb\" id=\"u371eb0cb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">请结合前面所学的SSD1306屏幕驱动和本节RTC案例，制作一个简易的小时钟。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6c634705\" id=\"u6c634705\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fjpeg%2F27903758%2F1745200357606-9a47313c-4187-4b50-8a67-9a0ef04a3402.jpeg%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u3e8820a7-cad0-4c3e-a521-4bf5524aa5f%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u2ca84235-f4af-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A627.6666870117188%2C%22height%22%3A575%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22230ac52eb99f136705f197db3b59b6d.jpg%22%2C%22size%22%3A726188%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1396%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1279%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%94%85%E5%92%96%22%2C%22x%22%3A486%2C%22y%22%3A354%2C%22width%22%3A587%2C%22height%22%3A56%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GNDVCCCLKMOSLDCCS1FSOCS2%22%2C%22x%22%3A482%2C%22y%22%3A416%2C%22width%22%3A557%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ICHEIMACOM%22%2C%22x%22%3A562%2C%22y%22%3A519%2C%22width%22%3A416%2C%22height%22%3A40%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222825-4-15%22%2C%22x%22%3A557%2C%22y%22%3A630%2C%22width%22%3A338%2C%22height%22%3A49%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2219%3A35%3A19%22%2C%22x%22%3A565%2C%22y%22%3A686%2C%22width%22%3A296%2C%22height%22%3A44%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22O%22%2C%22x%22%3A889%2C%22y%22%3A950%2C%22width%22%3A247%2C%22height%22%3A106%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RTCEXAMPLE%22%2C%22x%22%3A569%2C%22y%22%3A738%2C%22width%22%3A397%2C%22height%22%3A44%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3Anull%2C%22y%22%3A0%2C%22width%22%3Anull%2C%22height%22%3A669%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23549491%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ufa7fbf0b%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"K1Rq6\" id=\"K1Rq6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua4a18732\" id=\"ua4a18732\">实现步骤</span></h3><h4 data-lake-id=\"a1s8c\" id=\"a1s8c\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span d